pve-smartraidmon (1.0.0-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * HP Smart Array S.M.A.R.T. monitoring via smartctl -d cciss,N
  * Web GUI integration with Proxmox VE 8.x
  * Auto-detection of controllers and drives
  * Drive health overview with status indicators
  * Detailed S.M.A.R.T. attribute viewer

